OL,3,GNEWSAOn patrol with fire marshals in
OL,4,Adry countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople have been urged to avoid
OL,7,Fstarting fires in national parks and
OL,8,Fmoorland due to the dry conditions.
OL,10,FMarshals at Dartmoor National Park in
OL,11,FDevon have been on patrol advising
OL,12,Fpeople about the risks while firebreaks
OL,13,Fhave also been built to help stop
OL,14,Fflames spreading.
OL,16,FDeputy head ranger Ella Briens said
OL,17,Ffires were not allowed in the park as
OL,18,Fwildfires at this time of year could
OL,19,Fhave a big impact on the surroundings.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
