OL,3,GNEWSAOn patrol with fire marshals in
OL,4,Adry countryside
OL,5,
OL,6,FCornwall Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,7,Fpeople should not to use disposable
OL,8,Fbarbecues while bonfires, campfires and
OL,9,Ffireworks should all be avoided.
